# Age of Mortals — class features (pp.25-49).
Bonus Feat	KEY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) ~ Bonus Feat	CATEGORY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:At 1st level and every three levels after (4th, 7th, 10th, 13th, 16th, 19th), a bonus feat from: Alertness, Combat Expertise (Improved Disarm, Improved Feint, Improved Trip), Combat Reflexes, Dodge (Mobility), Exotic Weapon Proficiency, Great Fortitude, Improved Initiative, Lightning Reflexes, Point Blank Shot (Far Shot), Power Attack (Improved Bull Rush), Quick Draw, Toughness, Weapon Finesse, Weapon Focus. Prerequisites still apply. The app opens a free feat choice; pick from the list.	SOURCEPAGE:p.24-27
Sailor Lore	KEY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) ~ Sailor Lore	CATEGORY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) A sailor lore check with a bonus of mariner level + Intelligence modifier to know local people, history, far places or superstitions; it may not be true. No taking 10 or 20. DCs (Table 1-1): 10 common knowledge; 20 known to select groups; 25 known only to a few; 30 unknown to the vast majority.	SOURCEPAGE:p.24-27
Seamanship +1	KEY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) ~ Seamanship +1	CATEGORY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) A competence bonus on Balance, Climb and Profession (sailor) checks: +1 at 1st, +2 at 5th, +3 at 9th, +4 at 13th, +5 at 17th (Table 1-2).	BONUS:SKILL|Balance,Climb,Profession (Sailor)|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.24-27
Dirty Strike +1d4	KEY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) ~ Dirty Strike +1d4	CATEGORY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) From 2nd level, an unexpected maneuver for extra damage: +1d4, +2d4 at 6th, +3d4 at 10th, +4d4 at 14th, +5d4 at 18th. The opponent makes a Reflex save with a DC equal to the mariner's modified attack roll; a success takes normal damage only. Only against creatures with a discernible anatomy; once per day per opponent (several opponents may be tried the same day).	SOURCEPAGE:p.24-27
Seamanship +2	KEY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) ~ Seamanship +2	CATEGORY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) A competence bonus on Balance, Climb and Profession (sailor) checks: +1 at 1st, +2 at 5th, +3 at 9th, +4 at 13th, +5 at 17th (Table 1-2).	BONUS:SKILL|Balance,Climb,Profession (Sailor)|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.24-27
Dirty Strike +2d4	KEY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) ~ Dirty Strike +2d4	CATEGORY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) From 2nd level, an unexpected maneuver for extra damage: +1d4, +2d4 at 6th, +3d4 at 10th, +4d4 at 14th, +5d4 at 18th. The opponent makes a Reflex save with a DC equal to the mariner's modified attack roll; a success takes normal damage only. Only against creatures with a discernible anatomy; once per day per opponent (several opponents may be tried the same day).	SOURCEPAGE:p.24-27
Seamanship +3	KEY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) ~ Seamanship +3	CATEGORY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) A competence bonus on Balance, Climb and Profession (sailor) checks: +1 at 1st, +2 at 5th, +3 at 9th, +4 at 13th, +5 at 17th (Table 1-2).	BONUS:SKILL|Balance,Climb,Profession (Sailor)|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.24-27
Dirty Strike +3d4	KEY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) ~ Dirty Strike +3d4	CATEGORY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) From 2nd level, an unexpected maneuver for extra damage: +1d4, +2d4 at 6th, +3d4 at 10th, +4d4 at 14th, +5d4 at 18th. The opponent makes a Reflex save with a DC equal to the mariner's modified attack roll; a success takes normal damage only. Only against creatures with a discernible anatomy; once per day per opponent (several opponents may be tried the same day).	SOURCEPAGE:p.24-27
Seamanship +4	KEY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) ~ Seamanship +4	CATEGORY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) A competence bonus on Balance, Climb and Profession (sailor) checks: +1 at 1st, +2 at 5th, +3 at 9th, +4 at 13th, +5 at 17th (Table 1-2).	BONUS:SKILL|Balance,Climb,Profession (Sailor)|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.24-27
Dirty Strike +4d4	KEY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) ~ Dirty Strike +4d4	CATEGORY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) From 2nd level, an unexpected maneuver for extra damage: +1d4, +2d4 at 6th, +3d4 at 10th, +4d4 at 14th, +5d4 at 18th. The opponent makes a Reflex save with a DC equal to the mariner's modified attack roll; a success takes normal damage only. Only against creatures with a discernible anatomy; once per day per opponent (several opponents may be tried the same day).	SOURCEPAGE:p.24-27
Seamanship +5	KEY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) ~ Seamanship +5	CATEGORY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) A competence bonus on Balance, Climb and Profession (sailor) checks: +1 at 1st, +2 at 5th, +3 at 9th, +4 at 13th, +5 at 17th (Table 1-2).	BONUS:SKILL|Balance,Climb,Profession (Sailor)|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.24-27
Dirty Strike +5d4	KEY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) ~ Dirty Strike +5d4	CATEGORY:Mariner (Age of Mortals) Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) From 2nd level, an unexpected maneuver for extra damage: +1d4, +2d4 at 6th, +3d4 at 10th, +4d4 at 14th, +5d4 at 18th. The opponent makes a Reflex save with a DC equal to the mariner's modified attack roll; a success takes normal damage only. Only against creatures with a discernible anatomy; once per day per opponent (several opponents may be tried the same day).	SOURCEPAGE:p.24-27
Arcane Thesis	KEY:Academy Sorcerer ~ Arcane Thesis	CATEGORY:Academy Sorcerer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:At 1st, 4th, 7th and 10th level choose a thesis; choosing one again raises its competence bonuses by the base amount (Aeromancy twice: +4 competence and +2 DC). Aeromancy: +2 competence on saves against wind and air spells and spell-like abilities, +1 to the save DCs and to caster level checks against spell resistance of the air spells he casts. Cryomancy (ice and cold), Electromancy (lightning and electricity), Geomancy (stone and earth), Hydromancy (acid and water), Pyromancy (fire and heat) and Spectramancy (light, and illusions of the figment subschool): as Aeromancy for their element. Divination: +2 competence on Search, Search a class skill, and divinations targeting non-living creatures or objects count as one level higher for their effect. Enhancement: +2 competence on all Craft checks and a bonus item creation feat. Summoning: Conjuration (summoning) and teleportation spells count as one level higher. Transmutation: +2 competence on Craft (alchemy), and transmutations affecting non-living targets count as one level higher.	SOURCEPAGE:p.27-30
Academy Resources	KEY:Academy Sorcerer ~ Academy Resources	CATEGORY:Academy Sorcerer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:Arcane research and item creation take half the normal time while he lives at or attends the Academy (or another institution the DM approves). He must spend at least half of each year training other sorcerers.	SOURCEPAGE:p.27-30
Cooperative Study +2	KEY:Academy Sorcerer ~ Cooperative Study +2	CATEGORY:Academy Sorcerer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) Raises the bonus he gives with aid another on Craft (alchemy), Knowledge (arcana), Spellcraft and Use Magic Device; up to three more sorcerers with this ability may aid one character, to a total bonus of +10. The book prints two scales on p.29: Table 1-4 gives +2 at 2nd, +4 at 5th, +6 at 8th, and the text gives a total of +3 at 2nd, +5 at 5th, +7 at 8th. Ask your DM which applies.	SOURCEPAGE:p.27-30
Research Breakthrough	KEY:Academy Sorcerer ~ Research Breakthrough	CATEGORY:Academy Sorcerer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:At 3rd, 6th and 9th level, a bonus metamagic feat.	SOURCEPAGE:p.27-30
Cooperative Study +4	KEY:Academy Sorcerer ~ Cooperative Study +4	CATEGORY:Academy Sorcerer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) Raises the bonus he gives with aid another on Craft (alchemy), Knowledge (arcana), Spellcraft and Use Magic Device; up to three more sorcerers with this ability may aid one character, to a total bonus of +10. The book prints two scales on p.29: Table 1-4 gives +2 at 2nd, +4 at 5th, +6 at 8th, and the text gives a total of +3 at 2nd, +5 at 5th, +7 at 8th. Ask your DM which applies.	SOURCEPAGE:p.27-30
Cooperative Study +6	KEY:Academy Sorcerer ~ Cooperative Study +6	CATEGORY:Academy Sorcerer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) Raises the bonus he gives with aid another on Craft (alchemy), Knowledge (arcana), Spellcraft and Use Magic Device; up to three more sorcerers with this ability may aid one character, to a total bonus of +10. The book prints two scales on p.29: Table 1-4 gives +2 at 2nd, +4 at 5th, +6 at 8th, and the text gives a total of +3 at 2nd, +5 at 5th, +7 at 8th. Ask your DM which applies.	SOURCEPAGE:p.27-30
Bonus Domain	KEY:Citadel Mystic ~ Bonus Domain	CATEGORY:Citadel Mystic Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:At 1st level, a new clerical domain from Alteration, Animal, Channeling, Good, Insight, Meditation, Mentalism, Plant, Restoration, Sensitivity or Sun: its granted power, and with mystic levels its domain spells as bonus spells known (no extra spells per day). With the Sun domain (already or as this one), Citadel mystic levels add to mystic levels for turning undead.	SOURCEPAGE:p.30-32
Reputation +2	KEY:Citadel Mystic ~ Reputation +2	CATEGORY:Citadel Mystic Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) The listed bonus on Charisma-based skill checks with prisoners, peasants, refugees, rulers, nobles and authority figures; a penalty of the same size instead with enemies of the Citadel (such as the Knights of Neraka).	SOURCEPAGE:p.30-32
Mystic Secret	KEY:Citadel Mystic ~ Mystic Secret	CATEGORY:Citadel Mystic Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) At 3rd, 5th, 7th and 9th level, permanently modify one spell known with Empower Spell or Extend Spell, without raising its level and without the feat.	SOURCEPAGE:p.30-32
Heart's Grace	KEY:Citadel Mystic ~ Heart's Grace	CATEGORY:Citadel Mystic Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) At 4th and 8th level, choose a save (Fortitude, Reflex or Will) to add your Charisma bonus to; not the same save twice.	SOURCEPAGE:p.30-32
Reputation +4	KEY:Citadel Mystic ~ Reputation +4	CATEGORY:Citadel Mystic Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) The listed bonus on Charisma-based skill checks with prisoners, peasants, refugees, rulers, nobles and authority figures; a penalty of the same size instead with enemies of the Citadel (such as the Knights of Neraka).	SOURCEPAGE:p.30-32
Reputation +6	KEY:Citadel Mystic ~ Reputation +6	CATEGORY:Citadel Mystic Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) The listed bonus on Charisma-based skill checks with prisoners, peasants, refugees, rulers, nobles and authority figures; a penalty of the same size instead with enemies of the Citadel (such as the Knights of Neraka).	SOURCEPAGE:p.30-32
Turn Undead	KEY:Kender Nightstalker ~ Turn Undead	CATEGORY:Kender Nightstalker Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:Turns undead as a good-aligned cleric.	SOURCEPAGE:p.32-34
Death Sight	KEY:Kender Nightstalker ~ Death Sight	CATEGORY:Kender Nightstalker Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Sp) Once per day per class level, detect undead without concentrating; caster level half the nightstalker level.	SOURCEPAGE:p.32-34
Aura of Innocence	KEY:Kender Nightstalker ~ Aura of Innocence	CATEGORY:Kender Nightstalker Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Hostile incorporeal undead within 30 feet make a Will save (DC 10 + nightstalker level + Charisma modifier) or are affected as if he had cast sanctuary on himself; one that saves is immune for 24 hours.	SOURCEPAGE:p.32-34
Whispers of the Dead +2	KEY:Kender Nightstalker ~ Whispers of the Dead +2	CATEGORY:Kender Nightstalker Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) In an enclosed area where five or more creatures have been killed, a +2 insight bonus on Listen, Search and Spot checks; +4 at 6th level, +6 at 9th.	SOURCEPAGE:p.32-34
Spirit Companion	KEY:Kender Nightstalker ~ Spirit Companion	CATEGORY:Kender Nightstalker Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:At 4th level, a ghost cohort (Monster Manual ghost) of his alignment, 3 Hit Dice below his character level: once a human, elf, dwarf, gnome, kender or half-ogre. If it is destroyed for good, no new one until his next level. A second at 8th level. They advance as cohorts.	SOURCEPAGE:p.32-34
Necromantic Resistance	KEY:Kender Nightstalker ~ Necromantic Resistance	CATEGORY:Kender Nightstalker Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) +4 sacred bonus on all saves against necromancy effects.	SOURCEPAGE:p.32-34
Whispers of the Dead +4	KEY:Kender Nightstalker ~ Whispers of the Dead +4	CATEGORY:Kender Nightstalker Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) In an enclosed area where five or more creatures have been killed, a +2 insight bonus on Listen, Search and Spot checks; +4 at 6th level, +6 at 9th.	SOURCEPAGE:p.32-34
Spirit Handling	KEY:Kender Nightstalker ~ Spirit Handling	CATEGORY:Kender Nightstalker Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:May lend his Open Lock and Sleight of Hand skill bonus to a companion while it is manifested.	SOURCEPAGE:p.32-34
Whispers of the Dead +6	KEY:Kender Nightstalker ~ Whispers of the Dead +6	CATEGORY:Kender Nightstalker Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) In an enclosed area where five or more creatures have been killed, a +2 insight bonus on Listen, Search and Spot checks; +4 at 6th level, +6 at 9th.	SOURCEPAGE:p.32-34
Spectral Symbiosis	KEY:Kender Nightstalker ~ Spectral Symbiosis	CATEGORY:Kender Nightstalker Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:Each companion gains 2 more Hit Dice (undead HD). On a rejuvenation check a companion may use his Will save bonus instead of its HD. If a companion is destroyed for good, he makes a DC 15 Fortitude save or loses 200 XP per nightstalker level (100 on a success); never a lost level.	SOURCEPAGE:p.32-34
Legacy's Courage	KEY:Legion Mystic ~ Legacy's Courage	CATEGORY:Legion Mystic Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Immune to fear; allies within 30 feet who are aware of him gain +4 on saves against fear.	SOURCEPAGE:p.34-36
Legacy's Strength	KEY:Legion Mystic ~ Legacy's Strength	CATEGORY:Legion Mystic Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Once a day, add his Charisma or Intelligence bonus (the higher) to Strength as an enhancement bonus for 1 round per Legion mystic level.	SOURCEPAGE:p.34-36
Legacy's Awareness	KEY:Legion Mystic ~ Legacy's Awareness	CATEGORY:Legion Mystic Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Adds his Legion mystic level to Listen, Search, Sense Motive and Spot checks, and his Wisdom modifier to initiative as an insight bonus.	SOURCEPAGE:p.34-36
Legacy's Virtue	KEY:Legion Mystic ~ Legacy's Virtue	CATEGORY:Legion Mystic Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Immune to compulsions and charms; allies within 30 feet who are aware of him gain +4 on saves against them.	SOURCEPAGE:p.34-36
Legacy's Justice	KEY:Legion Mystic ~ Legacy's Justice	CATEGORY:Legion Mystic Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Once a day, smite evil: + Wisdom bonus to the attack and + character level to the damage; against a non-evil target it fails and is used. Also discern lies once a day per point of Wisdom bonus.	SOURCEPAGE:p.34-36
Region Familiarity	KEY:Legion Scout ~ Region Familiarity	CATEGORY:Legion Scout Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) At 1st, 3rd and 5th level choose a region (Abanasinia, Blode, Blood Sea Isles, Estwilde, Hylo, Icereach, Kern, Kharolis, Khur, Lemish, Neraka, Nightlund, Nordmaar, Northern Ergoth, Palanthas (city), Plains of Dust, Qualinesti, Sancrist, Sanction (city), Schallsea, Silvanesti, Solamnia, Southern Ergoth, Teyr, Thorbardin, Throtl, Zhakar): +2 competence on Legion knowledge, Gather Information and Survival checks there. Not the same region twice.	SOURCEPAGE:p.36-37
Face in the Crowd	KEY:Legion Scout ~ Face in the Crowd	CATEGORY:Legion Scout Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) After 24 hours in a city or area, +4 circumstance on Bluff and Disguise checks to pass as a local or commoner.	SOURCEPAGE:p.36-37
Sneak Attack +1d6	KEY:Legion Scout ~ Sneak Attack +1d6	CATEGORY:Legion Scout Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) As the rogue's, stacking with sneak attack from other classes: +1d6 at 2nd level, +2d6 at 5th.	SOURCEPAGE:p.36-37
Fifth Column	KEY:Legion Scout ~ Fifth Column	CATEGORY:Legion Scout Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) After 24 hours in a town, +4 circumstance on Bluff and Disguise to pass as a guard, soldier or militia member (not stacking with face in the crowd); while the ruse holds, +2 insight on Gather Information about troop movements, plans, prisoners and the like.	SOURCEPAGE:p.36-37
Safe Haven	KEY:Legion Scout ~ Safe Haven	CATEGORY:Legion Scout Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) A hidden place for (Legion scout level + Wisdom modifier) people, each gaining +10 circumstance on Hide checks against authorities and searchers (not the scout). Search DC: thorp, hamlet or village 30; small or large town 25; small or large city 20; metropolis 15; +2 if the authorities are evil or despotic, -2 if absent or trusting. Lasts while the scout stays, plus a day per day spent preparing it, up to a month.	SOURCEPAGE:p.36-37
Fly in the Ointment	KEY:Legion Scout ~ Fly in the Ointment	CATEGORY:Legion Scout Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) After a week's preparation, an opposed Bluff against an official's Sense Motive (no taking 10 or 20): success gives +2 insight on attack rolls, skill checks and initiative against him and his chain of command for 24 hours; failure means no retry for a month (or until he is replaced).	SOURCEPAGE:p.36-37
Sneak Attack +2d6	KEY:Legion Scout ~ Sneak Attack +2d6	CATEGORY:Legion Scout Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) As the rogue's, stacking with sneak attack from other classes: +1d6 at 2nd level, +2d6 at 5th.	SOURCEPAGE:p.36-37
Share Divination	KEY:Legion Sorcerer ~ Share Divination	CATEGORY:Legion Sorcerer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Casting a divination as a full-round action extends its effect to others he chooses within 30 feet, up to his caster level in number; he stays the center.	SOURCEPAGE:p.37-38
Canny Spellcraft	KEY:Legion Sorcerer ~ Canny Spellcraft	CATEGORY:Legion Sorcerer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) Adds his Intelligence bonus to caster level checks to overcome spell resistance, and to his saves against spells and spell-like abilities (not when flat-footed or unaware).	SOURCEPAGE:p.37-38
Confound Divination	KEY:Legion Sorcerer ~ Confound Divination	CATEGORY:Legion Sorcerer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) A Will save to resist scrying (as the spell), even when none is normally allowed, including attempts to view his surroundings; no effect on detect good, discern lies and similar spells.	SOURCEPAGE:p.37-38
Covert Spellcraft	KEY:Legion Sorcerer ~ Covert Spellcraft	CATEGORY:Legion Sorcerer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) Choose 3 + Intelligence bonus known spells to modify permanently with Silent Spell, without a higher slot or longer casting time.	SOURCEPAGE:p.37-38
Counter Divination	KEY:Legion Sorcerer ~ Counter Divination	CATEGORY:Legion Sorcerer Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) When targeted by a divination, a standard action Will save (DC 15 + the diviner's caster level): success reveals the diviner's identity and location; failure cannot be retried. Nondetection and false vision protect the diviner as if he were the one scrying.	SOURCEPAGE:p.37-38
Favored Embassy	KEY:Master Ambassador ~ Favored Embassy	CATEGORY:Master Ambassador Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) Choose a political setting (usually a capital): there, +2 on Diplomacy, Gather Information, Knowledge (nobility and royalty) and Sense Motive. At 4th, 7th and 10th level add another, or raise one by +2. Moving a court's bonus elsewhere takes a month without it, then a Diplomacy check (DC 20 + the old bonus). War does not remove a bonus, though diplomacy there may get harder.	SOURCEPAGE:p.38-40
Insightful Acclimation	KEY:Master Ambassador ~ Insightful Acclimation	CATEGORY:Master Ambassador Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) After ten minutes of conversation or close observation of someone of another culture, race, politics or religion, a Sense Motive check learns cultural or local information (Table 1-13): DC 10 common; 20 uncommon but available; 25 obscure or carefully guarded; 30 extremely obscure, secret or taboo.	SOURCEPAGE:p.38-40
Retinue +1	KEY:Master Ambassador ~ Retinue +1	CATEGORY:Master Ambassador Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) Gains the Leadership feat, with +1 to his leadership score; +2 at 5th, +3 at 8th. If he already has Leadership he gains the score bonus only.	SOURCEPAGE:p.38-40
Bonus Language	KEY:Master Ambassador ~ Bonus Language	CATEGORY:Master Ambassador Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) A new language at 3rd, 6th and 9th level.	SOURCEPAGE:p.38-40
Retinue +2	KEY:Master Ambassador ~ Retinue +2	CATEGORY:Master Ambassador Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) Gains the Leadership feat, with +1 to his leadership score; +2 at 5th, +3 at 8th. If he already has Leadership he gains the score bonus only.	SOURCEPAGE:p.38-40
Retinue +3	KEY:Master Ambassador ~ Retinue +3	CATEGORY:Master Ambassador Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) Gains the Leadership feat, with +1 to his leadership score; +2 at 5th, +3 at 8th. If he already has Leadership he gains the score bonus only.	SOURCEPAGE:p.38-40
Spirit Sight	KEY:Nomad Shaman ~ Spirit Sight	CATEGORY:Nomad Shaman Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Sees ethereal creatures as easily as material ones (and cannot easily tell which is which).	SOURCEPAGE:p.40-43
Totemic Insight	KEY:Nomad Shaman ~ Totemic Insight	CATEGORY:Nomad Shaman Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) At 1st, 3rd, 5th, 7th and 9th level, an insight from Table 1-15 whose number is no more than her class level + Wisdom modifier: 1 ancestral knowledge (4 ranks in a Knowledge, Craft or Profession skill she has no ranks in); 2 animal cunning (+2 initiative); 3 gift of the land (+2 Survival in her tribe's terrain); 4 animal awareness (+1 Listen, Search and Spot); 5 ancestral providence (+1 Will and Reflex saves); 6 gift of the wild (+1 attack and damage in her tribe's terrain); 7 animal fury (rage as a barbarian of her class level, or one more use a day if she has it); 8 ancestral might (+1 inherent bonus to Strength, Dexterity or Constitution); 9 gift of the elements (resistance 5 + Wisdom bonus to two energy types, or her Wisdom bonus added to resistance she has); 10 vision of the spirits (true seeing once a day as a spell-like ability).	SOURCEPAGE:p.40-43
Turn or Rebuke Spirit	KEY:Nomad Shaman ~ Turn or Rebuke Spirit	CATEGORY:Nomad Shaman Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Turns (an evil shaman rebukes) spirits, any incorporeal or ethereal undead, outsider or creature, as a cleric of her level turns undead; it cannot destroy them (those it would destroy are turned for twice as long). Does not stack with a cleric's or Sun-domain mystic's turning.	SOURCEPAGE:p.40-43
Spirit Body 1/day	KEY:Nomad Shaman ~ Spirit Body 1/day	CATEGORY:Nomad Shaman Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Gains the ghost touch quality for striking, grasping and defending against incorporeal creatures and objects (no miss chance, armor counts, her damaging spells work normally, and they can touch her too) for 3 rounds + 1 per point of Charisma bonus: once a day at 4th level, twice at 6th, three times at 8th, four times at 10th.	SOURCEPAGE:p.40-43
Spirit Body 2/day	KEY:Nomad Shaman ~ Spirit Body 2/day	CATEGORY:Nomad Shaman Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Gains the ghost touch quality for striking, grasping and defending against incorporeal creatures and objects (no miss chance, armor counts, her damaging spells work normally, and they can touch her too) for 3 rounds + 1 per point of Charisma bonus: once a day at 4th level, twice at 6th, three times at 8th, four times at 10th.	SOURCEPAGE:p.40-43
Spirit Body 3/day	KEY:Nomad Shaman ~ Spirit Body 3/day	CATEGORY:Nomad Shaman Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Gains the ghost touch quality for striking, grasping and defending against incorporeal creatures and objects (no miss chance, armor counts, her damaging spells work normally, and they can touch her too) for 3 rounds + 1 per point of Charisma bonus: once a day at 4th level, twice at 6th, three times at 8th, four times at 10th.	SOURCEPAGE:p.40-43
Spirit Body 4/day	KEY:Nomad Shaman ~ Spirit Body 4/day	CATEGORY:Nomad Shaman Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Gains the ghost touch quality for striking, grasping and defending against incorporeal creatures and objects (no miss chance, armor counts, her damaging spells work normally, and they can touch her too) for 3 rounds + 1 per point of Charisma bonus: once a day at 4th level, twice at 6th, three times at 8th, four times at 10th.	SOURCEPAGE:p.40-43
Honor's Price	KEY:Rogue Knight ~ Honor's Price	CATEGORY:Rogue Knight Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) A penalty equal to his class level on Charisma-based skill checks with his former brothers and any knighthood that holds his order honorable; an equal bonus with the underworld, criminals and other dishonorable or unsavory characters.	SOURCEPAGE:p.43-44
Desperate Strike +1d6	KEY:Rogue Knight ~ Desperate Strike +1d6	CATEGORY:Rogue Knight Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) While flanked by two or more opponents, the bonus on all melee damage rolls: +1d6, +2d6 at 4th level, +3d6 at 7th, +4d6 at 10th. Stacks with other damage bonuses such as sneak attack; no effect on creatures immune to critical hits (undead, oozes, plants, constructs).	SOURCEPAGE:p.43-44
Dire Providence (Lethal Damage to Subdual)	KEY:Rogue Knight ~ Dire Providence (Lethal Damage to Subdual)	CATEGORY:Rogue Knight Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) 3rd level: once a day, when damage would bring him to 0 hit points or lower, a Fortitude save (DC = the damage dealt) halves it. 6th level: his chance to stabilize below 0 hit points, and to waken when unconscious, doubles to a base 20%, and anyone using Heal to stabilize him gains +4. 9th level: a Fortitude save (DC = the attacker's modified attack roll) turns a critical hit into normal damage.	SOURCEPAGE:p.43-44
Desperate Strike +2d6	KEY:Rogue Knight ~ Desperate Strike +2d6	CATEGORY:Rogue Knight Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) While flanked by two or more opponents, the bonus on all melee damage rolls: +1d6, +2d6 at 4th level, +3d6 at 7th, +4d6 at 10th. Stacks with other damage bonuses such as sneak attack; no effect on creatures immune to critical hits (undead, oozes, plants, constructs).	SOURCEPAGE:p.43-44
Dire Providence (Stabilization)	KEY:Rogue Knight ~ Dire Providence (Stabilization)	CATEGORY:Rogue Knight Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) 3rd level: once a day, when damage would bring him to 0 hit points or lower, a Fortitude save (DC = the damage dealt) halves it. 6th level: his chance to stabilize below 0 hit points, and to waken when unconscious, doubles to a base 20%, and anyone using Heal to stabilize him gains +4. 9th level: a Fortitude save (DC = the attacker's modified attack roll) turns a critical hit into normal damage.	SOURCEPAGE:p.43-44
Desperate Strike +3d6	KEY:Rogue Knight ~ Desperate Strike +3d6	CATEGORY:Rogue Knight Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) While flanked by two or more opponents, the bonus on all melee damage rolls: +1d6, +2d6 at 4th level, +3d6 at 7th, +4d6 at 10th. Stacks with other damage bonuses such as sneak attack; no effect on creatures immune to critical hits (undead, oozes, plants, constructs).	SOURCEPAGE:p.43-44
Dire Providence (Critical Hits)	KEY:Rogue Knight ~ Dire Providence (Critical Hits)	CATEGORY:Rogue Knight Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) 3rd level: once a day, when damage would bring him to 0 hit points or lower, a Fortitude save (DC = the damage dealt) halves it. 6th level: his chance to stabilize below 0 hit points, and to waken when unconscious, doubles to a base 20%, and anyone using Heal to stabilize him gains +4. 9th level: a Fortitude save (DC = the attacker's modified attack roll) turns a critical hit into normal damage.	SOURCEPAGE:p.43-44
Desperate Strike +4d6	KEY:Rogue Knight ~ Desperate Strike +4d6	CATEGORY:Rogue Knight Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) While flanked by two or more opponents, the bonus on all melee damage rolls: +1d6, +2d6 at 4th level, +3d6 at 7th, +4d6 at 10th. Stacks with other damage bonuses such as sneak attack; no effect on creatures immune to critical hits (undead, oozes, plants, constructs).	SOURCEPAGE:p.43-44
Magic of Loyalty	KEY:Solamnic Auxiliary Mage ~ Magic of Loyalty	CATEGORY:Solamnic Auxiliary Mage Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) At the start of a combat, choose an ally he holds an oath of loyalty or service with: his spells that protect, defend or support that ally have +2 to their save DC, and he has +2 on saves against mind-influencing effects while defending that ally.	SOURCEPAGE:p.45-46
Heroic Initiative +1	KEY:Solamnic Auxiliary Mage ~ Heroic Initiative +1	CATEGORY:Solamnic Auxiliary Mage Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) +1 on initiative at 2nd level, +2 at 4th.	BONUS:COMBAT|INITIATIVE|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.45-46
Magic of Courage	KEY:Solamnic Auxiliary Mage ~ Magic of Courage	CATEGORY:Solamnic Auxiliary Mage Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Immune to fear, and adds his Wisdom modifier (if positive) as a sacred bonus on Spellcraft checks to identify and counter fear spells.	SOURCEPAGE:p.45-46
Heroic Initiative +2	KEY:Solamnic Auxiliary Mage ~ Heroic Initiative +2	CATEGORY:Solamnic Auxiliary Mage Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) +1 on initiative at 2nd level, +2 at 4th.	BONUS:COMBAT|INITIATIVE|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.45-46
Magic of Justice	KEY:Solamnic Auxiliary Mage ~ Magic of Justice	CATEGORY:Solamnic Auxiliary Mage Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Once per encounter, against one opponent he and the Knights seek to bring to justice, +2 to all his spell save DCs until the encounter ends; he must know who it is and it must be aware of him.	SOURCEPAGE:p.45-46
Exotic Weapon Proficiency	KEY:Spellfilch ~ Exotic Weapon Proficiency	CATEGORY:Spellfilch Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:At 1st level, proficiency with one Small or Tiny exotic weapon of her choice.	SOURCEPAGE:p.46-48
Spellwise (Skills)	KEY:Spellfilch ~ Spellwise (Skills)	CATEGORY:Spellfilch Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Expend a spell slot or prepared spell as a move action to enhance an action; no aspect more than once a day. 1st: a competence bonus equal to the slot's level on one check with a class skill. 3rd: +1d6 sneak attack damage per level of the slot on one attack (wasted on a miss). 5th: a bonus equal to the slot's level on her next Reflex save, lasting rounds equal to her caster level or until she makes one. 7th: a dodge bonus to AC equal to the slot's level for rounds equal to her caster level or until next attacked. 9th: an insight bonus equal to the slot's level on her next attack of opportunity, for rounds equal to her caster level or until she makes one.	SOURCEPAGE:p.46-48
Signature Spell 1/day	KEY:Spellfilch ~ Signature Spell 1/day	CATEGORY:Spellfilch Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Choose a known spell at most one level below her highest: she casts it spontaneously as a spell-like ability, using no slot, and may apply a metamagic feat (the modified level still one below her highest). Arcane or divine as her main casting class. Once a day at 2nd level, twice at 4th, three times at 6th, four at 8th, five at 10th; at each of those levels she may switch to another spell of the same school. Spellcraft checks to identify it take +1 + her Charisma modifier (if positive), and its aura reads one degree stronger.	SOURCEPAGE:p.46-48
Spellwise (Sneak Attack)	KEY:Spellfilch ~ Spellwise (Sneak Attack)	CATEGORY:Spellfilch Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Expend a spell slot or prepared spell as a move action to enhance an action; no aspect more than once a day. 1st: a competence bonus equal to the slot's level on one check with a class skill. 3rd: +1d6 sneak attack damage per level of the slot on one attack (wasted on a miss). 5th: a bonus equal to the slot's level on her next Reflex save, lasting rounds equal to her caster level or until she makes one. 7th: a dodge bonus to AC equal to the slot's level for rounds equal to her caster level or until next attacked. 9th: an insight bonus equal to the slot's level on her next attack of opportunity, for rounds equal to her caster level or until she makes one.	SOURCEPAGE:p.46-48
Signature Spell 2/day	KEY:Spellfilch ~ Signature Spell 2/day	CATEGORY:Spellfilch Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Choose a known spell at most one level below her highest: she casts it spontaneously as a spell-like ability, using no slot, and may apply a metamagic feat (the modified level still one below her highest). Arcane or divine as her main casting class. Once a day at 2nd level, twice at 4th, three times at 6th, four at 8th, five at 10th; at each of those levels she may switch to another spell of the same school. Spellcraft checks to identify it take +1 + her Charisma modifier (if positive), and its aura reads one degree stronger.	SOURCEPAGE:p.46-48
