Signature Spell 5/day	KEY:Spellfilch ~ Signature Spell 5/day	CATEGORY:Spellfilch Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) Choose a known spell at most one level below her highest: she casts it spontaneously as a spell-like ability, using no slot, and may apply a metamagic feat (the modified level still one below her highest). Arcane or divine as her main casting class. Once a day at 2nd level, twice at 4th, three times at 6th, four at 8th, five at 10th; at each of those levels she may switch to another spell of the same school. Spellcraft checks to identify it take +1 + her Charisma modifier (if positive), and its aura reads one degree stronger.	SOURCEPAGE:p.46-48
Arcane Aegis (1 ally)	KEY:War Mage ~ Arcane Aegis (1 ally)	CATEGORY:War Mage Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) One ally within 30 feet gains his Charisma modifier (if positive) as a morale bonus to AC; two allies at 3rd level, three at 5th.	SOURCEPAGE:p.48-49
Battle Magic +1	KEY:War Mage ~ Battle Magic +1	CATEGORY:War Mage Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) His damaging spells deal +1 damage per die; +2 at 3rd level, +3 at 5th.	SOURCEPAGE:p.48-49
Armored Spellcasting -5%	KEY:War Mage ~ Armored Spellcasting -5%	CATEGORY:War Mage Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) Arcane spell failure from his armor drops by 5% at 2nd level and 10% at 4th; stacks with other classes' such abilities (Knight of the Thorn); it does not lift another class's armor restrictions (Wizards of High Sorcery).	SOURCEPAGE:p.48-49
Metamagic	KEY:War Mage ~ Metamagic	CATEGORY:War Mage Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) At 2nd and 4th level, a bonus metamagic feat from Empower Spell, Enlarge Spell, Maximize Spell and Widen Spell.	SOURCEPAGE:p.48-49
Arcane Aegis (2 allies)	KEY:War Mage ~ Arcane Aegis (2 allies)	CATEGORY:War Mage Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) One ally within 30 feet gains his Charisma modifier (if positive) as a morale bonus to AC; two allies at 3rd level, three at 5th.	SOURCEPAGE:p.48-49
Battle Magic +2	KEY:War Mage ~ Battle Magic +2	CATEGORY:War Mage Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) His damaging spells deal +1 damage per die; +2 at 3rd level, +3 at 5th.	SOURCEPAGE:p.48-49
Armored Spellcasting -10%	KEY:War Mage ~ Armored Spellcasting -10%	CATEGORY:War Mage Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) Arcane spell failure from his armor drops by 5% at 2nd level and 10% at 4th; stacks with other classes' such abilities (Knight of the Thorn); it does not lift another class's armor restrictions (Wizards of High Sorcery).	SOURCEPAGE:p.48-49
Arcane Aegis (3 allies)	KEY:War Mage ~ Arcane Aegis (3 allies)	CATEGORY:War Mage Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Su) One ally within 30 feet gains his Charisma modifier (if positive) as a morale bonus to AC; two allies at 3rd level, three at 5th.	SOURCEPAGE:p.48-49
Battle Magic +3	KEY:War Mage ~ Battle Magic +3	CATEGORY:War Mage Class Feature	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:(Ex) His damaging spells deal +1 damage per die; +2 at 3rd level, +3 at 5th.	SOURCEPAGE:p.48-49
